      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. I'll improve its understandability by removing unused imports and constants, adding clarifying comments that explain the intent of each assertion, and giving the test a `@DisplayName`.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertNotNull`, `assertTrue`, `EOFException`, `ParameterizedTest`, `MethodSource`, `StringUtils`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, added a `@DisplayName` annotation, and added inline comments explaining the reasoning behind each of the three post-close assertions."
